\"tokenIds\": \"[\\\"99715488964417214066652199511187267721963086959461714627958930922819755740122\\\", \\\"19405834769133359089426335642143711653309738799401770550977513691248588502032\\\"]\",\n          \"side\": \"NO\",\n          \"entryPrice\": 0.14,\n          \"size\": 178.57142857142856,\n          \"cost\": 25,\n          \"openedAt\": \"2026-02-02T00:19:10.434Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"conditionId\": \"0xdee5db5410b362783a1405b66b9aa08a7d050ae1f99e8da85b9d1ae7962dad3b\",\n          \"market\": \"Will Harvey Weinstein be sentenced to between 20 and 30 years in prison?\",\n          \"tokenIds\": \"[\\\"40689385937970031985272152180777653235879119412231903065658922913468759560353\\\", \\\"109223657334725476924710634471321315385389367621714474291402615707818729630121\\\"]\",\n          \"side\": \"NO\",\n          \"entryPrice\": 0.608,\n          \"size\": 41.11842105263158,\n          \"cost\": 25,\n          \"openedAt\": \"2026-02-02T00:19:20.565Z\"","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1769991596904}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b93898a","parentId":"6ed510eb","timestamp":"2026-02-02T00:19:56.934Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01XpVzxJxrDhC2EZ4xW4EMM4","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026-02-01: 24 findings (18 threats, 0 opportunities) across 5 projects/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/reports/joc-leads-2026-02-01.md\n/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/reports/2026-02-01.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":29,"aggregated":"2026-02-01: 24 findings (18 threats, 0 opportunities) across 5 projects/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/reports/joc-leads-2026-02-01.md\n/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/reports/2026-02-01.md","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1769991596933}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5f7ad32","parentId":"9b93898a","timestamp":"2026-02-02T00:20:19.918Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me build both files:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01RjMtS2szwjjmh73KBAAtcK","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/mission-control/server.js","content":"const express = require('express');\nconst { execSync } = require('child_process');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst http = require('http');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = 3200;\n\napp.use(express.static(__dirname));\n\nfunction fetchLocal(url, timeout = 3000) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const req = http.get(url, { timeout }, res => {\n      let data = '';\n      res.on('data', c => data += c);\n      res.on('end', () => {\n        try { resolve(JSON.parse(data)); } catch { resolve(data); }\n      });\n    });\n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.on('timeout', () => { req.destroy(); reject(new Error('timeout')); });\n  });\n}\n\napp.get('/api/activity', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const logs = execSync('pm2 logs --nostream --lines 30 2>/dev/null || true', { timeout: 5000, encoding: 'utf8' });\n    const lines = logs.split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim()).slice(-20).reverse();\n    const activities = lines.map(l => {\n      const match = l.match(/(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}T[\\d:]+|\\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2})/);\n      const time = match ? match[1] : '';\n      let icon = '📋';\n      if (l.includes('heartbeat') || l.includes('HEARTBEAT')) icon = '💓';\n      else if (l.includes('polymarket') || l.includes('scan')) icon = '📊';\n      else if (l.includes('error') || l.includes('Error')) icon = '🔴';\n      else if (l.includes('telegram') || l.includes('message')) icon = '📤';\n      else if (l.includes('agent') || l.includes('sub-agent')) icon = '🔧';\n      else if (l.includes('scout')) icon = '🔍';\n      const desc = l.replace(/^.*?\\|\\s*/, '').substring(0, 120);\n      return { time: time.slice(-8), icon, desc };\n    });\n    res.json(activities);\n  } catch (e) { res.json([]); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/polymarket', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const data = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/data/strategy-state.json', 'utf8'));\n    res.json(data);\n  } catch (e) { res.json({ error: e.message }); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/scout', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const dir = '/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/reports/';\n    const latest = fs.readFileSync(path.join(dir, 'latest.txt'), 'utf8').trim();\n    const files = fs.readdirSync(dir).filter(f => f.match(/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}\\.md$/)).sort().reverse();\n    let content = '';\n    let stat = null;\n    if (files.length) {\n      const fp = path.join(dir, files[0]);\n      content = fs.readFileSync(fp, 'utf8');\n      stat = fs.statSync(fp);\n    }\n    // Parse JOC leads\n    let jocLeads = 0;\n    const jocFiles = fs.readdirSync(dir).filter(f => f.includes('joc-leads') && f.endsWith('.json'));\n    if (jocFiles.length) {\n      try {\n        const joc = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(dir, jocFiles.sort().reverse()[0]), 'utf8'));\n        jocLeads = Array.isArray(joc) ? joc.length : (joc.leads?.length || 0);\n      } catch {}\n    }\n    res.json({ summary: latest, content: content.substring(0, 2000), lastScan: stat?.mtime, jocLeads, filename: files[0] });\n  } catch (e) { res.json({ error: e.message }); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/medtech', async (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const health = await fetchLocal('http://localhost:3000/health');\n    res.json(health);\n  } catch (e) { res.json({ error: e.message }); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/system', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const cpu = execSync(\"top -bn1 | grep 'Cpu(s)' | awk '{print $2}'\", { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 5000 }).trim();\n    const mem = execSync(\"free -m | awk 'NR==2{printf \\\"%s %s %s\\\", $2,$3,$7}'\", { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 5000 }).trim().split(' ');\n    const disk = execSync(\"df -h / | awk 'NR==2{printf \\\"%s %s %s %s\\\", $2,$3,$4,$5}'\", { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 5000 }).trim().split(' ');\n    const uptime = execSync('uptime -p', { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 5000 }).trim();\n    res.json({\n      cpu: parseFloat(cpu) || 0,\n      ram: { total: parseInt(mem[0]) || 0, used: parseInt(mem[1]) || 0, available: parseInt(mem[2]) || 0 },\n      disk: { total: disk[0], used: disk[1], free: disk[2], percent: disk[3] },\n      uptime\n    });\n  } catch (e) { res.json({ error: e.message }); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/processes', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const list = JSON.parse(execSync('pm2 jlist', { encoding: 'utf8', timeout: 5000 }));\n    const procs = list.map(p => ({\n      name: p.name,\n      status: p.pm2_env?.status,\n      uptime: p.pm2_env?.pm_uptime,\n      restarts: p.pm2_env?.restart_time,\n      memory: p.monit?.memory,\n      cpu: p.monit?.cpu\n    }));\n    res.json(procs);\n  } catch (e) { res.json([]); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/costs', async (req, res) => {\n  try { res.json(await fetchLocal('http://localhost:3002/api/costs')); }\n  catch { res.json({ error: 'unavailable' }); }\n});\n\napp.get('/api/investments', async (req, res) => {\n  try { res.json(await fetchLocal('http://localhost:3002/api/investments')); }\n  catch { res.json({ error: 'unavailable' }); }\n});\n\napp.listen(PORT, () => console.log(`Mission Control on port ${PORT}`));\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":1914,"cacheRead":13147,"cacheWrite":1508,"totalTokens":16570,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.047850000000000004,"cacheRead":0.0065734999999999995,"cacheWrite":0.009425000000000001,"total":0.06385350000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769991596934}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1029443","parentId":"f5f7ad32","timestamp":"2026-02-02T00:20:19.927Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01RjMtS2szwjjmh73KBAAtcK","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 4926 bytes to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/mission-control/server.js"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769991619926}}
{"type":"message","id":"989cabbe","parentId":"e1029443","timestamp":"2026-02-02T00:21:36.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the big one — the index.html:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_013t3UJDuh1ETBWjFhmmFf51","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/mission-control/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>BAI BUREH — Mission Control</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n:root{--bg:#0a0a0f;--card:#12121a;--border:#1a1a2e;--text:#e0e0e0;--dim:#888;--green:#00ff88;--red:#ff4444;--blue:#4488ff;--gold:#ffaa00;--purple:#aa66ff}\nhtml,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}\n.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* Header */\n.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 24px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0e0e18 0%,var(--bg) 100%);border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a2e;position:relative}\n.header::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--purple),var(--blue),var(--green),transparent)}\n.header-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.header-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px}\n.header-title span{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green),var(--blue));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}\n.live-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);animation:pulse 2s infinite;box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green)}\n.live-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--green);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.header-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}\n#clock{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;color:var(--dim)}\n\n@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.5;transform:scale(1.2)}}\n@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}\n@keyframes glowPulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,255,136,.1)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,136,.2)}}\n\n/* Grid */\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px 24px;height:calc(100vh - 52px)}\n.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;transition:border-color .3s}\n.panel:hover{border-color:#2a2a4e}\n.panel-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.panel-title .icon{font-size:14px}\n\n/* Activity Feed */\n.activity-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:4px 0;font-size:12px;animation:fadeIn .4s ease;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.03)}\n.activity-item .time{color:var(--dim);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;min-width:52px;font-size:11px}\n.activity-item .icon{min-width:18px;text-align:center}\n.activity-item .desc{color:var(--text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-size:11px}\n\n/* Processes */\n.proc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}\n.proc-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;font-size:11px}\n.proc-name{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.proc-name .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0}\n.dot-online{background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--green);animation:pulse 2s infinite}\n.dot-stopped{background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--red)}\n.dot-errored{background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--gold)}\n.proc-meta{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* Polymarket */\n.strat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;height:calc(100% - 28px)}\n.strat-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;border-left:3px solid var(--dim);font-size:11px}\n.strat-card.profit{border-left-color:var(--green)}\n.strat-card.loss{border-left-color:var(--red)}\n.strat-name{font-weight:600;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px}\n.strat-stat{color:var(--dim);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}\n.strat-pnl{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:600}\n.pnl-pos{color:var(--green)}.pnl-neg{color:var(--red)}.pnl-zero{color:var(--dim)}\n\n/* Scout */\n.scout-summary{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.scout-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.scout-findings{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--dim)}\n.scout-findings li{list-style:none;padding:2px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.03)}\n.scout-meta{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:14px;right:14px;font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n\n/* Medtech */\n.med-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.med-stat{text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:6px;padding:8px}\n.med-stat .val{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green)}\n.med-stat .label{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px}\n.progress-bar{height:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}\n.progress-fill{height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),var(--blue));transition:width .5s}\n\n/* System */\n.sys-bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n.sys-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:11px}\n.sys-label{min-width:44px;color:var(--dim);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px}\n.sys-bar{flex:1;height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}\n.sys-fill{height:100%;border-radius:4px;transition:width .5s}\n.sys-val{min-width:40px;text-align:right;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px}\n.sys-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.sys-info-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px}\n.sys-info-item .val{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue)}\n.sys-info-item .label{color:var(--dim);font-size:9px;margin-top:1px}\n\n.unavailable{color:var(--dim);font-style:italic;font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:20px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-left\">\n    <div class=\"header-title\">🧠 <span>BAI BUREH</span> — MISSION CONTROL</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"header-right\">\n    <div class=\"live-label\"><div class=\"live-dot\"></div>LIVE</div>\n    <div id=\"clock\" class=\"mono\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n  <!-- Activity Feed -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-activity\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">📡</span> LIVE ACTIVITY FEED</div>\n    <div id=\"activity-list\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Processes -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-procs\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">⚙️</span> PROCESSES</div>\n    <div id=\"proc-grid\" class=\"proc-grid\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Polymarket -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-poly\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">📈</span> POLYMARKET STRATEGIES</div>\n    <div id=\"strat-grid\" class=\"strat-grid\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Scout -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-scout\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">🔍</span> SCOUT INTEL</div>\n    <div id=\"scout-content\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Medtech -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-med\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">🏥</span> BIOMED BORBOR</div>\n    <div id=\"med-content\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- System -->\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-sys\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\"><span class=\"icon\">🖥️</span> SYSTEM HEALTH</div>\n    <div id=\"sys-content\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n\nfunction updateClock() {\n  const now = new Date();\n  $('clock').textContent = now.toLocaleDateString('en-US', {weekday:'short',month:'short',day:'numeric'}) + '  ' + now.toLocaleTimeString('en-US',{hour12:false});\n}\nsetInterval(updateClock, 1000);\nupdateClock();\n\nasync function fetchJSON(url) {\n  try {\n    const r = await fetch(url, {signal: AbortSignal.timeout(5000)});\n    return await r.json();\n  } catch { return null; }\n}\n\nfunction timeAgo(ts) {\n  if (!ts) return '—';\n  const diff = Date.now() - new Date(ts).getTime();\n  const h = Math.floor(diff/3600000), m = Math.floor((diff%3600000)/60000);\n  if (h > 24) return Math.floor(h/24) + 'd ago';\n  if (h > 0) return h + 'h ' + m + 'm ago';\n  return m + 'm ago';\n}\n\nfunction formatBytes(b) {\n  if (!b) return '0 MB';\n  return (b / 1048576).toFixed(0) + ' MB';\n}\n\nfunction formatUptime(ts) {\n  if (!ts) return '—';\n  const diff = Date.now() - ts;\n  const h = Math.floor(diff/3600000), m = Math.floor((diff%3600000)/60000);\n  if (h > 24) return Math.floor(h/24) + 'd ' + (h%24) + 'h';\n  return h + 'h ' + m + 'm';\n}\n\nasync function loadActivity() {\n  const data = await fetchJSON('/api/activity');\n  if (!data || !data.length) { $('activity-list').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">No activity data</div>'; return; }\n  $('activity-list').innerHTML = data.slice(0, 10).map(a =>\n    `<div class=\"activity-item\"><span class=\"time\">${a.time}</span><span class=\"icon\">${a.icon}</span><span class=\"desc\">${a.desc}</span></div>`\n  ).join('');\n}\n\nasync function loadProcesses() {\n  const data = await fetchJSON('/api/processes');\n  if (!data || !data.length) { $('proc-grid').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">No process data</div>'; return; }\n  $('proc-grid').innerHTML = data.map(p => {\n    const dotClass = p.status === 'online' ? 'dot-online' : p.status === 'stopped' ? 'dot-stopped' : 'dot-errored';\n    return `<div class=\"proc-card\">\n      <div class=\"proc-name\"><span class=\"dot ${dotClass}\"></span>${p.name}</div>\n      <div class=\"proc-meta\">↑${formatUptime(p.uptime)} · ↻${p.restarts||0} · ${formatBytes(p.memory)}</div>\n    </div>`;\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nasync function loadPolymarket() {\n  const data = await fetchJSON('/api/polymarket');\n  if (!data || data.error || !data.strategies) { $('strat-grid').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">Polymarket unavailable</div>'; return; }\n  const strats = Object.entries(data.strategies);\n  $('strat-grid').innerHTML = strats.map(([name, s]) => {\n    const cls = s.pnl > 0 ? 'profit' : s.pnl < 0 ? 'loss' : '';\n    const pnlCls = s.pnl > 0 ? 'pnl-pos' : s.pnl < 0 ? 'pnl-neg' : 'pnl-zero';\n    const wins = s.trades ? s.trades.filter(t => t.profit > 0).length : 0;\n    const total = s.trades ? s.trades.length : 0;\n    const wr = total > 0 ? Math.round(wins/total*100) + '%' : '—';\n    return `<div class=\"strat-card ${cls}\">\n      <div class=\"strat-name\">${name}</div>\n      <div class=\"strat-stat\">Capital: $${s.capital.toFixed(0)}</div>\n      <div class=\"strat-stat\">P&L: <span class=\"strat-pnl ${pnlCls}\">${s.pnl >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${s.pnl.toFixed(2)}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"strat-stat\">Positions: ${(s.positions||[]).length} · Trades: ${total}</div>\n      <div class=\"strat-stat\">Win rate: ${wr}</div>\n    </div>`;\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nasync function loadScout() {\n  const data = await fetchJSON('/api/scout');\n  if (!data || data.error) { $('scout-content').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">Scout unavailable</div>'; return; }\n  // Parse summary line\n  const sumMatch = (data.summary||'').match(/(\\d+)\\s*findings.*?(\\d+)\\s*threats.*?(\\d+)\\s*opportunities/i);\n  const threats = sumMatch ? sumMatch[2] : '?';\n  const opps = sumMatch ? sumMatch[3] : '?';\n  const total = sumMatch ? sumMatch[1] : '?';\n  // Parse some findings from content\n  const lines = (data.content||'').split('\\n').filter(l => l.match(/^[\\-\\*]\\s/)).slice(0, 5);\n  const findings = lines.map(l => '<li>' + l.replace(/^[\\-\\*]\\s*/, '').substring(0, 100) + '</li>').join('');\n  $('scout-content').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"scout-summary\">\n      <div class=\"scout-badge\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">🔴 ${threats} threats</div>\n      <div class=\"scout-badge\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">🟢 ${opps} opps</div>\n      <div class=\"scout-badge\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">${total} total</div>\n      ${data.jocLeads ? `<div class=\"scout-badge\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">🎯 ${data.jocLeads} JOC leads</div>` : ''}\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"scout-findings\">${findings || '<li>No findings parsed</li>'}</ul>\n    <div class=\"scout-meta\">Last scan: ${timeAgo(data.lastScan)} · Report: ${data.filename || '—'}</div>`;\n}\n\nasync function loadMedtech() {\n  const data = await fetchJSON('/api/medtech');\n  if (!data || data.error) {\n    $('med-content').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">Biomed Borbor unavailable</div>'; return;\n  }\n  const techs = data.technicians || data.stats?.technicians || '—';\n  const issues = data.totalIssues || data.stats?.totalIssues || '—';\n  const resolved = data.resolvedIssues || data.stats?.resolvedIssues || '—';\n  const rate = (typeof issues === 'number' && typeof resolved === 'number' && issues > 0) ? Math.round(resolved/issues*100) : 0;\n  const wa = data.whatsapp || data.status || '—';\n  $('med-content').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"med-stats\">\n      <div class=\"med-stat\"><div class=\"val\">${techs}</div><div class=\"label\">Technicians</div></div>\n      <div class=\"med-stat\"><div class=\"val\">${issues}</div><div class=\"label\">Total Issues</div></div>\n      <div class=\"med-stat\"><div class=\"val\">${resolved}</div><div class=\"label\">Resolved</div></div>\n      <div class=\"med-stat\"><div class=\"val\" style=\"color:${wa==='connected'?'var(--green)':'var(--red)'}\">●</div><div class=\"label\">WhatsApp: ${wa}</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)\">Resolution Rate: ${rate}%</div>\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"><div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:${rate}%\"></div></div>`;\n}\n\nasync function loadSystem() {\n  const [sys, costs, inv] = await Promise.all([\n    fetchJSON('/api/system'),\n    fetchJSON('/api/costs'),\n    fetchJSON('/api/investments')\n  ]);\n  if (!sys || sys.error) { $('sys-content').innerHTML = '<div class=\"unavailable\">System unavailable</div>'; return; }\n  const cpuPct = sys.cpu || 0;\n  const ramPct = sys.ram.total ? Math.round(sys.ram.used / sys.ram.total * 100) : 0;\n  const diskPct = sys.disk.percent ? parseInt(sys.disk.percent) : 0;\n  function barColor(pct) { return pct > 80 ? 'var(--red)' : pct > 60 ? 'var(--gold)' : 'var(--green)'; }\n\n  let costHtml = '';\n  if (costs && !costs.error) {\n    const todayCost = costs.today || costs.dailyCost || costs.cost || '—';\n    costHtml = `<div class=\"sys-info-item\"><div class=\"val\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">$${typeof todayCost==='number'?todayCost.toFixed(2):todayCost}</div><div class=\"label\">API Cost Today</div></div>`;\n  }\n\n  let invHtml = '';\n  if (inv && !inv.error) {\n    const items = Array.isArray(inv) ? inv : (inv.investments || []);\n    items.forEach(i => {\n      invHtml += `<div class=\"sys-info-item\"><div class=\"val\" style=\"color:var(--purple)\">$${i.price||i.current_price||'—'}</div><div class=\"label\">${i.name||i.symbol||'—'}</div></div>`;\n    });\n  }\n\n  $('sys-content').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"sys-bars\">\n      <div class=\"sys-row\"><span class=\"sys-label\">CPU</span><div class=\"sys-bar\"><div class=\"sys-fill\" style=\"width:${cpuPct}%;background:${barColor(cpuPct)}\"></div></div><span class=\"sys-val\">${cpuPct.toFixed(1)}%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"sys-row\"><span class=\"sys-label\">RAM</span><div class=\"sys-bar\"><div class=\"sys-fill\" style=\"width:${ramPct}%;background:${barColor(ramPct)}\"></div></div><span class=\"sys-val\">${ramPct}%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"sys-row\"><span class=\"sys-label\">DISK</span><div class=\"sys-bar\"><div class=\"sys-fill\" style=\"width:${diskPct}%;background:${barColor(diskPct)}\"></div></div><span class=\"sys-val\">${sys.disk.percent}</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sys-info\">\n      <div class=\"sys-info-item\"><div class=\"val\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">${sys.uptime.replace('up ','')}</div><div class=\"label\">Uptime</div></div>\n      <div class=\"sys-info-item\"><div class=\"val\">${sys.ram.used}/${sys.ram.total} MB</div><div class=\"label\">Memory</div></div>\n      ${costHtml}\n      ${invHtml}\n    </div>`;\n}\n\nasync function refresh() {\n  await Promise.all([loadActivity(), loadProcesses(), loadPolymarket(), loadScout(), loadMedtech(), loadSystem()]);\n}\n\nrefresh();\nsetInterval(refresh, 10000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":6327,"cacheRead":14655,"cacheWrite":1954,"totalTokens":22937,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.158175,"cacheRead":0.0073275,"cacheWrite":0.012212500000000001,"total":0.17772}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769991619927}}
